    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうすぐオーディション会場だな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、そうですね",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なぁ、もう少しゆっくり歩かないか？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "どうしてですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このままだと、かなり早く着いてしまいそうだからな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "確かにそうですが……早めに着いて\r\nウォーミングアップをしておきたいんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……？\r\nどうしました？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや……\r\n何かがあるってわけじゃないんだけど……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ灯織とちゃんと話すタイミングがなかったから\r\nちょっとその時間が欲しくてな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "話、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。これからのプロデュースのためにも\r\n灯織のことが知りたいんだ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、俺のほうから\r\n少し質問させてもらってもいいか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、大丈夫です……その答えによって\r\nプロデュースの方針が変わったりしますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その可能性はゼロじゃないが\r\nもっと気楽に答えて欲しいかな",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……わかりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ……そうだな\r\nまず、趣味とかはあるか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "趣味……\r\n音楽鑑賞、でしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "休日とかは何してる？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "料理をしたり\r\n苦手なステップを反復練習したり……ですかね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "後はそうだな……\r\n学校生活とかはどうだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……すみません、少しいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうした、灯織？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "これがアイドル活動に役立つとは思えません\r\nもっと、建設的な質問をしてほしいです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうだよな、悪い……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……いえ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私のほうこそすみません……\r\n少し、言いすぎました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいんだ\r\n正直な意見をぶつけてくれて嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからずっと、一緒にやっていくからな\r\n本音でぶつかるのが１番だ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう、ですか……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私の言葉を、そんなふうに捉えてくれるとは\r\n思いませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺たちはパートナーだからな\r\nその代わり、俺も直球で聞いてもいいか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。お願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織は、どんなアイドルになりたいんだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は……輝くアイドルになりたい、です",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "輝くアイドル、か……なるほど",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "抽象的ですよね……すみません",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことない。俺は立派な目標だと思うぞ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます\r\n他にも質問はありますか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大事なことが聞けたからもう充分だ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004010240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\n改めて、これからよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200401/2002004010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。一緒に頑張っていこうな！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "っと……そろそろ時間か……\r\nって、灯織！　待ってくれ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0116",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
